// Prefer `ios/scripts/secrets.sh`, which writes this file for you.
//
// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (git-ignored) before the first device or Release
// build. The anon key is public by construction — the web ships it in every page
// load — but it is kept out of git so the repo carries no production credential
// material at all. The project URL is already in Base.xcconfig.
//
// Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API → anon / public key.
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = <the anon key>
